      "subtitle": "Ix-xogħol: what people do",
      "intro": "Common jobs and how to ask about them. Feminine forms are marked (f).",
      "facts": [
        "Most jobs make the feminine by adding -a: tabib becomes tabiba, kok becomes koka, għalliem becomes għalliema.",
        "A few borrowed jobs don't change, like mekkanik (mechanic)."
